<fieldset class="textile-controls studio-fieldset"><legend>Rear support and front harness</legend><p class="text-sm muted">Cut-and-sew bench dimensions. Mesh, padding, woven shell, straps and frame wraps are included. These are not a measured fit or load rating.</p><div class="textile-input-grid"><label>Rear saddle width<input name="slingWidth" form="{{ textileForm }}" type="number" step="5" required value="{{ initialGoods.slingWidth }}" :min="goodsBounds().slingWidth[0]" :max="goodsBounds().slingWidth[1]" x-model.number="slingWidth"><span>mm, across the frame</span></label><label>Rear saddle length<input name="slingLength" form="{{ textileForm }}" type="number" step="5" required value="{{ initialGoods.slingLength }}" :min="goodsBounds().slingLength[0]" :max="goodsBounds().slingLength[1]" x-model.number="slingLength"><span>mm, front to back</span></label><label>Leg opening width<input name="legWidth" form="{{ textileForm }}" type="number" step="5" required value="{{ initialGoods.legWidth }}" :min="goodsBounds().legWidth[0]" :max="goodsBounds().legWidth[1]" x-model.number="legWidth"><span>mm, each opening</span></label><label>Leg opening length<input name="legLength" form="{{ textileForm }}" type="number" step="5" required value="{{ initialGoods.legLength }}" :min="goodsBounds().legLength[0]" :max="goodsBounds().legLength[1]" x-model.number="legLength"><span>mm, each opening</span></label><label>Frame-to-saddle drop<input name="drop" form="{{ textileForm }}" type="number" step="5" required value="{{ initialGoods.drop }}" :min="goodsBounds().drop[0]" :max="goodsBounds().drop[1]" x-model.number="supportDrop"><span>mm, before loaded sag</span></label><label>Chest band circumference<input name="chest" form="{{ textileForm }}" type="number" step="5" required value="{{ initialGoods.chest }}" :min="goodsBounds().chest[0]" :max="goodsBounds().chest[1]" x-model.number="chestGirth"><span>mm, finished centerline</span></label></div><p class="studio-validation" role="alert" :if="goodsState().error">{{ goodsState().error }} A starting textile layout is shown until these dimensions are valid.</p><button type="button" class="studio-reset" @click="resetTextiles()">Reset textile dimensions</button><details class="textile-patterns"><summary>See the actual cut patterns</summary><p class="text-sm muted">Raw bound edges, no extra fold allowance. Download the kit for 1:1 SVG/DXF files, Letter/A4 tiles, sewing steps and the complete textile parts list.</p><div><figure><img :src="rearPattern()" alt="Selected rear saddle cut outline with two leg openings and open rear hygiene channel" width="350" height="350"><figcaption>Rear shell, pad and mesh</figcaption></figure><figure><img :src="frontPattern()" alt="Selected rounded front bib cut outline" width="350" height="350"><figcaption>Front bib, pad and mesh</figcaption></figure></div><a class="button-text" :href="textileUrl()">Download patterns and sewing guide</a></details><p class="text-xs muted">Webbing and the woven shell form the candidate support path. Metal adjusters, closure, seams, chafe protection and anchors still need qualification. Never print these fabric reference volumes as a harness.</p></fieldset>
